#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:3
#: 4706bb293bd24ae4a475cb85efd3c829
msgid "磁弹响应网格（Magnetoelastic Grid）"
msgstr "Magnetoelastic Grid"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:5
#: aad0a783befc499cbaf1fcd3455cb938
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:7
#: 845b6e8d20cf4c71aa9895ecd82d0f3e
msgid "这张卡做什么"
msgstr "What This Card Does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:9
#: 6809da7ff32c40719e0ed3159b040ba2
msgid "这张卡把一条晶格变形路径与一条局域自旋旋转路径组合成二维网格。每个晶格点都包含同一套完整的负角度、零角度和正角度结构，便于比较磁响应如何随体积或应变变化。"
msgstr ""
"Combine a lattice-deformation path with a local spin-rotation path to form a two-"
"dimensional grid. Every lattice point contains the same complete set of negative-"
"angle, zero-angle, and positive-angle structures, allowing magnetic response to be "
"compared as volume or strain changes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:11
#: df4e5ad2ca6f497ab2c4cbad1a904cb4
msgid "输入结构必须已有有限、非零的三维磁矩。列出的目标原子在每一帧中一起旋转，不会按原子分别生成多套输出。"
msgstr ""
"The input structure must already have finite, nonzero three-dimensional moments. "
"Listed target atoms rotate together in every frame; separate output sets are not "
"generated for individual atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:13
#: b3ce96c03faa4470a2afcde84c5e695a
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:15
#: d2a6615cb1ad432392892e20484c4285
msgid "自旋路径"
msgstr "Spin Path"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:17
#: 241aaf749d364e25bffdb715713cf0f8
msgid "目标原子的磁矩绕同一笛卡尔轴刚性旋转："
msgstr "Moments of target atoms rotate rigidly around the same Cartesian axis:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:19
#: fdad9d864f2d41be836919eab0ed1380
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf S_i(\\theta)=R_{\\hat{\\mathbf n}}(\\theta)\\mathbf S_i.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:23
#: 3828acd9310f4aaf855f423ae5be9727
msgid "因此磁矩模长保持不变；未列出的原子磁矩不变。若某个磁矩与旋转轴平行，它在该路径中不会改变。"
msgstr ""
"Moment magnitudes therefore remain unchanged, as do moments on unlisted atoms. A "
"moment parallel to the rotation axis does not change along this path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:25
#: fd20b0b5f0e94da9999f1d58866ef9cc
msgid "晶格路径"
msgstr "Lattice Path"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:27
#: 1f91198a14d54d1fa7c4055dfde11cc1
msgid "除 Bain 路径外，晶胞按"
msgstr "Except for the Bain path, the cell is updated as"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:29
#: 4d512d60a79d4657a0ea8cd3f267dc46
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf A'=\\mathbf A\\mathbf F^T\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:33
#: f017bf8eef29434eae29aacf9477c277
msgid "更新，原子的分数坐标保持不变。设界面输入的无量纲坐标为 $s$。"
msgstr ""
"while atomic fractional coordinates remain unchanged. Let the dimensionless "
"coordinate entered in the interface be $s$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:35
#: 8cc754bb332146daa159c89c76d16133
msgid "各向同性体积"
msgstr "Isotropic Volume"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:37
#: 2870ec84adf04a39b2b15ebdfee7f709
msgid "界面中的百分比表示真实体积变化，而不是三个晶格方向各自的线性变化："
msgstr ""
"The percentage in the interface represents the true volume change, not an independent"
" linear change along each of the three lattice directions:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:39
#: 6fd6d5209e574f25980294f66accd4db
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf F=(1+s)^{1/3}\\mathbf I,\n"
"\\qquad V'/V=1+s.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:44
#: f70495d1219e48149b524e04d213ad9f
msgid "单轴应变"
msgstr "Uniaxial Strain"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:46
#: e61ae20d657e42a98bb62de842f7255c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "设 $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ 为笛卡尔加载方向："
msgstr "Let $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ be the Cartesian loading direction:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:48
#: bd43059bbc404c54832ed02efb0def7a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf F=\\mathbf I+s\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\hat{\\mathbf n}^T.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:52
#: 14d449fa08d94ad698ef20d7758501d1
msgid "只改变该方向，垂直方向保持不变。"
msgstr "Only this direction changes; perpendicular directions remain unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:54
#: 6529c373849446b5aebf9d4f28f19772
msgid "双轴应变"
msgstr "Biaxial Strain"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:56
#: be1d8aa753104027b1526f904bfb1820
msgid "此处的方向参数是未应变平面的法向。与它垂直的平面内施加等量应变："
msgstr ""
"Here the direction parameter is the normal of the unstrained plane. Equal strain is "
"applied within the plane perpendicular to it:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:58
#: dd7a69634ded4eccac8b93a8160f67e4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf F=\\mathbf I+s\\left(\\mathbf I-\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\hat{\\mathbf "
"n}^T\\right).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:62
#: 34ba5104eb2c41ab9b64c63837a81fcc
msgid "因此 $V'/V=(1+s)^2$；例如 $s=2\\%$ 时，体积约增加 $4.04\\%$。"
msgstr ""
"Therefore $V'/V=(1+s)^2$; for example, when $s=2\\%$, the volume increases by "
"approximately $4.04\\%$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:64
#: c4fd7c3d0b5c44a1b8eaabb4b7b42961
msgid "对称剪切"
msgstr "Symmetric Shear"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:66
#: e25d21876158474481e585c57217552c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "用户给出两个互相垂直的笛卡尔方向 $\\hat{\\mathbf u}$ 和 $\\hat{\\mathbf v}$："
msgstr ""
"The user supplies two mutually perpendicular Cartesian directions $\\hat{\\mathbf u}$"
" and $\\hat{\\mathbf v}$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:68
#: 3fa576e712374933b67c6a800a6205aa
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf F=\\mathbf I+\\frac{s}{2}\n"
"\\left(\\hat{\\mathbf u}\\hat{\\mathbf v}^T+\n"
"\\hat{\\mathbf v}\\hat{\\mathbf u}^T\\right).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:74
#: c63363985de84e0dba9b8f1ba604f359
msgid "两个方向不垂直时运行会明确失败，不会由程序暗中选择剪切平面。"
msgstr ""
"If the two directions are not perpendicular, the operation fails explicitly rather "
"than silently choosing a shear plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:76
#: 5ba9c5a9d6dd471e93e12de27436e591
msgid "Bain / 四方路径"
msgstr "Bain / Tetragonal Path"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:78
#: 57bf8d079b00427b8520fa53e963d5ba
msgid ""
"选择晶格矢量 `a`、`b` 或 `c` 作为四方轴。令 $r=1+s$，选中轴乘以 $r$，另外两根晶格矢量各乘以 $1/\\sqrt "
"r$，因此体积保持不变。这里选择的是晶格矢量，不是笛卡尔方向。"
msgstr ""
"Select lattice vector `a`, `b`, or `c` as the tetragonal axis. Let $r=1+s$; multiply "
"the selected axis by $r$ and each of the other two lattice vectors by $1/\\sqrt r$, "
"preserving volume. This selects a lattice vector, not a Cartesian direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:80
#: 65fbc9d55b2c4f0380e7d53e21438dc6
msgid "输出数量"
msgstr "Output Count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:82
#: 7b4f73ff30d749aa83418eb3bf9e11cc
msgid "若晶格扫描含 $N_s$ 个点，自旋扫描含 $N_\\theta$ 个角度，理论输出为"
msgstr ""
"If the lattice scan contains $N_s$ points and the spin scan contains $N_\\theta$ "
"angles, the theoretical output count is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:84
#: 16bf17c1f2644a32816f1894ac62b4d4
msgid "N=N_sN_\\theta."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:86
#: 0fb84bee1fc44476a9580ab1c6e45d4e
msgid "“最大结构数”只在完整的自旋组之间截断。实际保留的晶格点数为"
msgstr ""
"`Maximum structures` truncates only between complete spin groups. The actual number "
"of retained lattice points is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:88
#: c5eb275e9265489eade841eec1789a2a
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{s,\\mathrm{keep}}=\\min\\left(N_s,\n"
"\\left\\lfloor\\frac{N_{\\max}}{N_\\theta}\\right\\rfloor\\right).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:93
#: f1bc636ff2104bafa206ad65e31d09df
msgid "若上限连一个完整自旋组都容纳不了，卡片会报错；界面预览会直接显示理论数量和实际保留数量。"
msgstr ""
"If the limit cannot accommodate even one complete spin group, the card reports an "
"error. The interface preview shows both the theoretical and retained actual counts "
"directly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:95
#: de983cfe6e2a4c0c86a131a8d4dffc4e
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:97
#: 8b2013968b304252bf5437fa91eea348
msgid ""
"若模型能拟合平衡结构，却不能复现受拉伸时局域磁响应的变化，可选择 `Uniaxial strain`，结构扫描设为 `-2,-1,0,1,2 %`，自旋扫描设为 "
"`-2,0,2°`，并指定目标原子与真实笛卡尔旋转轴。输出包含 5 个晶格点、每点 3 帧，共 15 个结构。回填 DFT 标签后，应按 `response_group`"
" 保留完整三帧，再比较不同结构坐标下的能量或磁力响应。"
msgstr ""
"If a model fits equilibrium structures but cannot reproduce how local magnetic "
"response changes under tension, select `Uniaxial strain`, set the structural scan to "
"`-2,-1,0,1,2 %`, the spin scan to `-2,0,2°`, and specify target atoms and the "
"physical Cartesian rotation axis. The output contains five lattice points with three "
"frames each, for 15 structures. After filling DFT labels, retain each complete three-"
"frame `response_group` and compare energy or magnetic-force responses at different "
"structural coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:99
#: def28964ab61475c98467ab793b79005
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:101
#: d643423a349c43948f53a41d5c886185
msgid "晶格路径（structural_mode）"
msgstr "Lattice Path (structural_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:103
#: 991caaf752994962a8c45d216af7f338
msgid ""
"默认 `Isotropic volume`。可选 `Isotropic volume`、`Uniaxial strain`、`Biaxial "
"strain`、`Symmetric shear` 和 `Bain / tetragonal`。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Isotropic volume`. Available values are `Isotropic volume`, `Uniaxial "
"strain`, `Biaxial strain`, `Symmetric shear`, and `Bain / tetragonal`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:105
#: 9f13f61f7fc841cdbf0a556d15f546c8
msgid "结构扫描（structural_scan）"
msgstr "Structural Scan (structural_scan)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:107
#: c564778871b341e1bbe46445063199e4
msgid "默认 `-0.02,-0.01,0,0.01,0.02`，序列化值为无量纲坐标。界面显示为 `-2,-1,0,1,2 %`，至少需要三个不同值并包含 0。"
msgstr ""
"Default `-0.02,-0.01,0,0.01,0.02`, serialized as dimensionless coordinates. The "
"interface displays `-2,-1,0,1,2 %`. At least three distinct values are required and "
"zero must be included."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:109
#: 81bdac25e1c9471ead5e772ead849faa
msgid "自旋旋转扫描（spin_scan_deg）"
msgstr "Spin-Rotation Scan (spin_scan_deg)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:111
#: 5867c808d8854450b6332e706c955bd2
msgid "默认 `-2,0,2` 度。每个晶格点都生成同一套扫描；至少需要三个不同角度并包含 0。"
msgstr ""
"Default `-2,0,2` degrees. Every lattice point generates the same scan. At least three"
" distinct angles are required and zero must be included."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:113
#: 34a0502485b643b8b1dc411f46c719fd
msgid "自旋旋转轴（rotation_axis）"
msgstr "Spin-Rotation Axis (rotation_axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:115
#: 0b166f6ccc0e4c2aacc36ea952f456c8
msgid "默认 `[0,1,0]`，为实验室笛卡尔方向。所有目标磁矩绕该轴一起旋转。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[0,1,0]`, a laboratory Cartesian direction. All target moments rotate "
"together around this axis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:117
#: 18f875ce1f6246b78699ab920f1723c7
msgid "共同旋转的原子（target_indices）"
msgstr "Atoms Rotated Together (target_indices)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:119
#: 6c97c41336de417e86cbff4f354ffa7b
msgid "默认 `1`，使用从 1 开始的原子索引；支持 `1,3-5`。多个索引表示同一帧内共同旋转，不增加输出组数。"
msgstr ""
"Default `1`, using 1-based atom indices; `1,3-5` is supported. Multiple indices "
"rotate together within one frame and do not increase the number of output groups."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:121
#: 0a4a7457e6e94b0d938828bd304fd115
msgid "结构方向（strain_axis）"
msgstr "Structural Direction (strain_axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:123
#: fb4a48c80f4f451199235005c7e8f980
msgid "默认 `[0,0,1]`，为笛卡尔方向。单轴模式中表示加载方向；双轴模式中表示未应变平面的法向；对称剪切中表示第一方向。各向同性和 Bain 模式不使用它。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[0,0,1]`, a Cartesian direction. It is the loading direction in uniaxial "
"mode, the normal of the unstrained plane in biaxial mode, and the first direction in "
"symmetric shear. Isotropic and Bain modes do not use it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:125
#: e5d3036e0c9b4650a73f517dd07193e2
msgid "第二剪切方向（shear_direction）"
msgstr "Second Shear Direction (shear_direction)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:127
#: a58911ef91b14329a33a4be8015513bd
msgid "默认 `[0,1,0]`，为笛卡尔方向，仅用于 `Symmetric shear`。它必须与 `strain_axis` 垂直。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[0,1,0]`, a Cartesian direction used only for `Symmetric shear`. It must be "
"perpendicular to `strain_axis`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:129
#: 16b9e7b529704c3ab3bcbc7ea1530cb3
msgid "Bain 晶格轴（bain_axis）"
msgstr "Bain Lattice Axis (bain_axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:131
#: 973362ee97c64d2ca248a39fbc9294d1
msgid "默认 `c`，可选 `a`、`b`、`c`，仅用于 `Bain / tetragonal`。该路径保持体积不变。"
msgstr ""
"Default `c`; available values are `a`, `b`, and `c`. Used only for `Bain / "
"tetragonal`. This path preserves volume."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:133
#: 957ad785a3174d3694950af8f5880d00
msgid "最大结构数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "Maximum Structures (max_outputs)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:135
#: d12e9c7f4ac54f6b8dfa99549f5642cd
msgid "默认 `100`。只保留能够完整容纳的晶格点；不会截断某个晶格点内部的自旋扫描。"
msgstr ""
"Default `100`. Only lattice points that fit completely are retained; the spin scan "
"within a lattice point is never truncated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:137
#: 80600924d5d9472e8d2f3c7b7f4073c2
msgid "旧工作流提示"
msgstr "Legacy Workflow Notice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:139
#: da99d09c4f1a4d869aa9f735ea9385ba
msgid "旧版本虽然保存了“自旋旋转轴”，实际生成时没有使用它。新版会真正绕保存的笛卡尔轴旋转，因此加载旧卡片时会显示提示。旧对称剪切工作流缺少第二方向时，会恢复旧版本曾隐式选择的方向；建议检查后重新保存。"
msgstr ""
"Earlier versions stored `Spin-rotation axis` but did not use it during generation. "
"The current version rotates around the saved Cartesian axis, so loading a legacy card"
" displays a notice. If an old symmetric-shear workflow lacks a second direction, the "
"direction previously chosen implicitly is restored; inspect it and save the workflow "
"again."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:141
#: 39b436a33a47473492761013c0d50993
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:143
#: 1f093af0ac2f491baf7ed12a02262f4c
msgid "**双轴应变为什么体积变化不是输入百分比？** 输入值分别作用于平面内两个方向，因此体积比为 $(1+s)^2$。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does biaxial strain not change the volume by the input percentage?** The input "
"value applies separately to two in-plane directions, so the volume ratio is "
"$(1+s)^2$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:144
#: 971461e0e0e04c8abd137673976bb1fa
msgid "**某个目标自旋为什么没有变化？** 若它与旋转轴平行，绕该轴旋转后方向不变。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does a target spin not change?** If it is parallel to the rotation axis, "
"rotating around that axis leaves its direction unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:145
#: c83e6889f17f4291ad2b54973fb4ffc9
msgid "**输出数为什么小于两个扫描长度的乘积？** “最大结构数”只保留能够完整容纳的晶格点，界面预览会显示实际数量。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the output count smaller than the product of the two scan lengths?** "
"`Maximum structures` retains only lattice points that fit completely, and the "
"interface preview shows the actual count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:147
#: f353093cbb4144f49f144026850a8f87
msgid "输出字段"
msgstr "Output Fields"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetoelastic-response-card.md:149
#: 57098c17b988426f8a9c494725e9456a
msgid ""
"输出磁矩写入 `spin:R:3`。每个晶格点对应一个完整 `response_group`；manifest "
"记录结构坐标、变形梯度、应变张量、自旋旋转轴、目标原子以及当前模式实际使用的笛卡尔方向或 Bain 晶格轴。"
msgstr ""
"Output moments are written to `spin:R:3`. Every lattice point corresponds to one "
"complete `response_group`; the manifest records the structural coordinate, "
"deformation gradient, strain tensor, spin-rotation axis, target atoms, and the "
"Cartesian directions or Bain lattice axis actually used by the current mode."
